<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Severomoravska 1996 net CZK 542 mln vs 591.</title>
<headline>Severomoravska 1996 net CZK 542 mln vs 591.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited results for year ending December 31, 1996 (in millions of crowns).</p>
<p>				     1996     vs	1995</p>
<p> Total assets		 9,476.779	  9,487.896</p>
<p> Basic capital		3,315.142	  3,315.142</p>
<p>Sales of products</p>
<p> and services		13,404.673	 13,133.082</p>
<p> Operating profit	     747.802	    949.814</p>
<p> After tax profit	     542.426	    591.266</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		 870.503	  1,020.569</p>
<p>NOTE - Severomoravska Energetika a.s. is a regional energy distributor based in Ostrava. It is listed on the main market of the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
